    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST THE FULL GAME!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br>This the <strong>FREE</strong> version of <strong>Lament of Kyoto</strong>, an Action Roguelike where you fight waves of Yokai in feudal Japan inspired by <i>Vampire Survivors</i> and <i>Holocure</i>. Along your journey you will find unlikely allies, discover secrets and hidden locations and plenty of weapons to fight your way to victory. Upgrade these weapons by combining your special Esper Powers with the lingering Yokai energy to create even crazier weapons!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184820/extras/878c80caf9b45e0d46d53f0dce2bc79c.poster.avif?t=1667218364\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184820/extras/878c80caf9b45e0d46d53f0dce2bc79c.webm?t=1667218364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Content in this FREE version</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> The Haunted Manor map<br></li><li> Minibosses and event waves<br></li><li> Three playable characters, each with a unique gameplay style<br></li><li> First weapon set + their upgrades<br></li><li> Passives to give you even more power<br></li><li> Beautiful Japanese aesthetics <br></li><li> Music inspired by our favorite Touhou tracks</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184820/extras/e325e4035b87647fe1ace1cac2b8e0d4.poster.avif?t=1667218364\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184820/extras/e325e4035b87647fe1ace1cac2b8e0d4.webm?t=1667218364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Our transparent development process</strong></h2>We are constantly working on the base game, and will periodically update this free version to test out features we might want to add and gather feedback from our community. So join our Discord, and help us shape <strong>Lament of Kyoto</strong>!",
